Package: bayesmokken.clustered.polytomous.replication
Title: Replication Package for Cluster-Aware Uncertainty for Polytomous Mokken
    Scalability
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", email = "jlee296@ua.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: Rebuilds every number, figure and table in Lee (2026) from a frozen
    analysis snapshot spanning a feasibility pilot, a training and held-out
    validation split, a fresh 24-cell confirmation at 6,400 replications per
    population target, and an application to the SWMDK data distributed with the
    'mokken' package. Ships the complete raw draw streams of the application,
    the 86,400 raw confirmation replication rows, the hash-locked protocol and
    receipt files that fixed each rule before the outcomes it governs existed,
    an annotated reference copy of the pipeline, and an independent oracle lane
    for the finite comonotone transport computation. This is not an R package
    and is not meant to be installed; the DESCRIPTION declares the dependency
    contract that 00_setup.R checks.
